   "widgets_values": [
    "REFINED UPSCALE FOR ANY IMAGE (SDXL tiles)\n\nDrag an image onto Load Image. Replace the first line of the prompt with a short description of the picture (subject, style, medium), then queue.\ndenoise 0.2-0.35: higher adds more detail but drifts from the original. upscale_by 2 = 2x; ~3.5 from 1024 px for A4 at 300 dpi.\nFor images made by our generation workflows, prefer their own Upscale group (same model + prompt).\nOutput: output/upscaled/."
   ]
